WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.667
Watch time is the most important metric most creators ignore.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:14.000
Most focus on views. If the number's high, they think they're winning.

3
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:25.333
1 million views, 5 seconds average watch time? Algorithm ignores you.

4
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:31.333
100,000 views, 45 seconds average? Algorithm pushes you everywhere.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Watch time is the clearest signal that content is genuinely valuable.

6
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:47.667
Strong hook in 3 seconds. No filler. Deliver on your title's promise.

7
00:00:47.833 --> 00:00:53.333
80% completion on a 60-second video is an extremely valuable signal.

8
00:00:53.667 --> 00:01:00.000
High retention leads to more distribution. More distribution = more watch time.

9
00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:04.667
That's the flywheel. Understand it and use it.

10
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.667
Learn digital marketing at 0xverse Academy.

